---
import "../../../../packages/design-tokens/tokens.css";
const workspace=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_WORKSPACE_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:3019';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Synapse: sourced, checked and human-approved programme reporting."/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon.svg"/><title>Synapse — sourced reporting demo</title></head><body><header><a href="/" class="brand">Synapse<span>TEAM OASIS</span></a><a href={workspace}>Open workspace ↗</a></header><main><p class="label">SOURCE → CHECK → REVIEW</p><h1>Every report.<br/>Back to its source.</h1><p class="intro">Turn programme updates into checked, bilingual funder reports. Keep the evidence visible and the final decision with a person.</p><a class="button" href={workspace}>Explore the demo ↗</a><p class="note">Fictional data · recorded responses · human approval</p><section><h2>One reporting workflow</h2><ol><li><b>Receive and preserve.</b> Keep the original report and its source.</li><li><b>Check and prepare.</b> Compare numbers, follow citations and prepare English or French text.</li><li><b>Review and export.</b> A person approves the current revision before confirming its export.</li></ol></section><section><h2>Find the evidence</h2><p>Ask what a report is missing or where a number came from. Synapse uses the reporting API to return verified records and links. The current demo makes no live model call.</p></section></main><footer>Synapse / Team Oasis <span>Fictional data · Recorded responses</span></footer></body></html>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font-body),system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}a{color:var(--primary)}header,footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:24px max(24px,6vw);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}a.brand{text-decoration:none;font-size:28px;font-weight:650}.brand span{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted)}main{max-width:1040px;margin:auto;padding:72px 32px}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,76px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--primary);margin:20px 0 28px}.label,.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.label{letter-spacing:.12em}.intro{max-width:630px;font-size:20px}.button{display:inline-block;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px;margin:14px 0}.note{margin-bottom:64px}section{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0}h2{font-size:28px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--primary);font-weight:600}li{margin:18px 0}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--primary);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:600px){header,footer{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;padding:20px}main{padding:40px 20px}.intro{font-size:18px}}
</style>
